  "comments": "Date of composition: lo sum stong bzhi brgya dgu bcu rtsa gsum pa'i dus su | gdong ngan gyi lo sa ga'i dkar phyogs tshes brgyad (the eigth day of Vai\u015b\u0101kha \u015b\u016bkla pak\u1e63a (Buddha's birthday), male fire monkey year) = 1356, 1416/17 or 1476. [N77QW83A]: 187, n. 156 adopts the date 1356.\r\n\r\nThe work is based on the teaching of dKa' bzhi pa Shes rab seng ge (ID:3860). If the work dates from 1356, this Shes rab seng ge cannot be rGyud smad Shes rab seng ge (ID:4123) (1383-1445).\r\n\r\nThis commentary on the vinayak\u0101rik\u0101 m\u0101l\u0101k\u0101ra - one of the three that survived - is discussed in [N77QW83A]: 186-189, n. 156 and [UGZJBIWM]: 374-375.",
